Z||000005||Terrible Tom||11-19-2000||10:04 PM||||If you get divorced in Arkansas, is your x-wife still your cousin?<P>What is similar in Arkansas between a tornado and a divorce?<P>In either case, someone's losing a trailer.<P>Bill and Hill were driving through Little Rock one nite when they saw a drunk standing on a corner.  They recognized the drunk as someone Hill had dated before she married Bill.  Bill said "Aren't you glad u married me?"  Hill replied, "Why, if I married him, then he would be President!!"||||reg||1
